<TD VALIGN="MIDDLE" WIDTH="260" HEIGHT="23">3. 양수가액(원)</TD>
<TD VALIGN="MIDDLE" ALIGN="CENTER" WIDTH="128" HEIGHT="23">거래 종결</TD>
<TD VALIGN="MIDDLE" ALIGN="RIGHT" WIDTH="399" HEIGHT="23">10,310,400,000,000</TD>
<TD VALIGN="MIDDLE" ALIGN="RIGHT" WIDTH="398" HEIGHT="23">11,120,537,000,000</TD>
